      "text": "Short-term = context window = RAM\nfast, small, ephemeral\nLong-term = persisted + retrieved storage\nRAG / files / database",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "baseline": 13,
      "containerId": "uOd8JGPDxRZtcKlX5vFr",
      "originalText": "Short-term = context window = RAM\nfast, small, ephemeral\nLong-term = persisted + retrieved storage\nRAG / files / database",
