      "text": "Memory types:\nepisodic = events and traces\nsemantic = facts and knowledge\nprocedural = habits / instructions\nstorage format is a separate axis",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
