      "text": "Retrieval = semantic match + recency + importance\nDecay = forgetting as a feature\nmanages signal, staleness, and cost\nmemory needs curation like context",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "baseline": 13,
      "containerId": "WGQqMHBzR71k10rAiw6r",
      "originalText": "Retrieval = semantic match + recency + importance\nDecay = forgetting as a feature\nmanages signal, staleness, and cost\nmemory needs curation like context",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
